{
  "model": "2000",
  "line": "marwin",
  "displayName": "Marwin 2000 series Class 150 flanged ball valve",
  "match": ["2000 series", "2000f", "2000r", "marwin 2000", "class 150 flanged ball"],
  "source": { "doc": "2000-full-150.pdf and 2000-reduced-150.pdf", "page": 4, "section": "Ordering matrix" },
  "note": "Extracted by hand from the ordering matrices of the full and reduced port Class 150 sheets, which share every table. The code reads model, size, body, the F1 end connection element, then single character packing-seat and ends, and pairs for operation, actuator pressure, solenoid, limit switch and fail position. This family has no 1-1/4 inch, no positioner position and no accessory position, and its operation table stops at P8 and S9 with electrics to MA, all exactly as printed. The book's automated code 2000F-050-CS-F1/BFS280000001 decodes through this model letter for letter. Nema 7 electric remains the per-enquiry caution per James, July 2026.",
